[[2047,127,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"removing\" data-part=\"removal\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"refitting\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</a><p><a href=\"#/3238254\">5010C12</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3238799\">7040A37</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3238800\">7040A44</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3238830\">7040G24</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3238829\">7040G20</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3238795\">7040A31</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3238788\">7040A09</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3238803\">7040A65</a>\n                                           (left\nand right sides)</p><p><a href=\"#/3238343\">5040D22</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3238986\">7065C42</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3238514\">5570T80</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3237934\">2125C24</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3238802\">7040A60</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3238117\">3380A44</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3238851\">7040L28</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3238849\">7040L20</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3238501\">5560C51</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3238460\">5540C18</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3238502\">5560C60</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3238496\">5560B02</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3238497\">5560B03</a></p><aside class=\"note\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/769.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2000041.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th colspan=\"1\"><aside class=\"note\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/767.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"><p>Before working on the Air Bag\nsystem follow the safety instructions for working on the system carefully\n(\n                                                               <a href=\"#/3238524\">5580C</a>\n                                                                ).</p></aside></th></tr><tr><td></td><td colspan=\"1\"></td></tr></table></div></aside><p><a href=\"#/3238527\">5580C18</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3238121\">4110A11</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3238793\">7040A26</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3238525\">5580C12</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3238476\">5550A12</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3238528\">5580C22</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3238838\">7040H30</a>\n                                           (left\nand right sides)</p><p><a href=\"#/3238789\">7040A10</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3238787\">7040A05</a></p><p>1. Undo the bolts fixing the electrical connections and fuses bracket.</p><p>2. Move the bracket.</p><p>3. Undo the bolts fixing the dashboard trim supporting crossmember.</p><p>4. Remove the dashboard trim supporting crossmember after having\ndisconnected it from the wiring.</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2019241.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[2047,127,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"refitting\" data-part=\"refit\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"removing\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</a><p>Check that the dashboard trim\nsupporting crossmember is not damaged.</p><p>Position the crossmember and connect the\nwiring.</p><p>Tighten the bolts fixing the crossmember.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001243.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Fastening</p></th><th><p>Component</p></th><th><p>Ø</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Value</p><p>(daNm)</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>-</p></td><td><p>Nut</p></td><td><p>FACIA TRIMMOUNT BEAM</p></td><td><p>M6</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p>0.85</p></td></tr></table></div><p>Position the electrical connections and\nfuses bracket, then secure it using the bolts.</p><p><a href=\"#/3238787\">7040A05</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3238789\">7040A10</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3238838\">7040H30</a>\n                                           (left\nand right sides)</p><p><a href=\"#/3238528\">5580C22</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3238476\">5550A12</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3238525\">5580C12</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3238793\">7040A26</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3238121\">4110A11</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3238527\">5580C18</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3238497\">5560B03</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3238496\">5560B02</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3238502\">5560C60</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3238460\">5540C18</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3238501\">5560C51</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3238849\">7040L20</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3238851\">7040L28</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3238117\">3380A44</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3238802\">7040A60</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3237934\">2125C24</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3238514\">5570T80</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3238986\">7065C42</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3238343\">5040D22</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3238803\">7040A65</a>\n                                           (left\nand right sides)</p><p><a href=\"#/3238788\">7040A09</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3238795\">7040A31</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3238829\">7040G20</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3238830\">7040G24</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3238800\">7040A44</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3238799\">7040A37</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3238254\">5010C12</a></p><p>Check that the components involved are\ncorrectly fitted and working properly.</p>"],[2047,96,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"removing\" data-part=\"removal\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"refitting\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</a><p><a href=\"#/3238830\">7040G24</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3238829\">7040G20</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3238795\">7040A31</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3238803\">7040A65</a>\n                                           (left\nand right sides)</p><p><a href=\"#/3238852\">7040L37</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3238986\">7065C42</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3238849\">7040L20</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3238514\">5570T80</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3238342\">5040D18</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3238792\">7040A25</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3238501\">5560C51</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3238256\">5010C24</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3238254\">5010C12</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3238799\">7040A37</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3238800\">7040A44</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3238801\">7040A45</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3238788\">7040A09</a></p><aside class=\"note\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/768.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2000166.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th colspan=\"1\"><aside class=\"note\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/767.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"><p>Before working on the Air Bag\nsystem follow the safety instructions for working on the system carefully\n(). (\n                                                               <a href=\"#/3238524\">5580C</a>\n                                                                )</p></aside></th></tr><tr><td></td><td colspan=\"1\"></td></tr></table></div></aside><p><a href=\"#/3238528\">5580C22</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3238460\">5540C18</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3238502\">5560C60</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3238496\">5560B02</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3238497\">5560B03</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3238527\">5580C18</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3238121\">4110A11</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3238793\">7040A26</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3238476\">5550A12</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3238789\">7040A10</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3238787\">7040A05</a></p><p>1. Undo the bolts fixing the electrical connections and fuses bracket.</p><p>2. Move the electrical connections and fuses bracket.</p><p>3. Disconnect the electrical connections (3a, 3b).</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>3a</p></td><td><p>Ignition switch</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><a href=\"#/3236072\">H1A</a></p></td></tr></table></div><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>3b</p></td><td><p>Ignition switch</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><a href=\"#/3236092\">H1B</a></p></td></tr></table></div><p>4. Undo the four bolts fixing the steering column to the crossmember.</p><p>5. Lower the steering column.</p><p>6. Undo the bolts fixing the crossmember.</p><p>7. Remove the crossmember after having released it from the wiring.</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2019242.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[2047,96,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"refitting\" data-part=\"refit\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"removing\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</a><p>Check that the dashboard crossmember is\nnot damaged.</p><p>Position the crossmember and the wiring.</p><p>Tighten the bolts fixing the crossmember.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001243.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Fastening</p></th><th><p>Component</p></th><th><p>Ø</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Value</p><p>(daNm)</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>-</p></td><td><p>Bolt</p></td><td><p>FACIA TRIMMOUNT BEAM</p></td><td><p>M6</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p>0.8</p></td></tr></table></div><p>Raise the steering column.</p><p>Tighten the bolts fixing the steering column.</p><p>Connect the electrical connection.</p><p>Position the electrical connections and\nfuses bracket.</p><p>Tighten the screws.</p><p><a href=\"#/3238787\">7040A05</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3238789\">7040A10</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3238476\">5550A12</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3238793\">7040A26</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3238121\">4110A11</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3238527\">5580C18</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3238497\">5560B03</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3238496\">5560B02</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3238502\">5560C60</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3238460\">5540C18</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3238528\">5580C22</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3238788\">7040A09</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3238801\">7040A45</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3238800\">7040A44</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3238799\">7040A37</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3238254\">5010C12</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3238256\">5010C24</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3238501\">5560C51</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3238792\">7040A25</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3238342\">5040D18</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3238514\">5570T80</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3238849\">7040L20</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3238986\">7065C42</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3238852\">7040L37</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3238803\">7040A65</a>\n                                           (left\nand right sides)</p><p><a href=\"#/3238795\">7040A31</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3238829\">7040G20</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3238830\">7040G24</a></p>"]]